rap\"><nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><li style=\"list-style:none\"><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"list-style:none\">/</li><li style=\"list-style:none\" aria-current=\"page\">Careers</li></nav></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.twinmos.com/index.html\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Careers\",\"item\":\"https://www.twinmos.com/careers.html\"}]}</script><main id=\"main\"><div class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Careers</span><h1 class=\"h1\">Build memory with us</h1><p class=\"lede\">A quarter-century-old memory specialist with the energy of a product company: engineering-led, globally distributed, and shipping to 93+ countries. Whether you are an experienced professional, a recent graduate or a student seeking an internship \u2014 if storage technology motivates you, we should talk.</p><div class=\"car-nav\" aria-label=\"Jump to section\"><a href=\"#openings\">Open roles</a> <a href=\"#departments\">Departments</a> <a href=\"#life\">Life at TwinMOS</a> <a href=\"#benefits\">Benefits</a> <a href=\"#locations\">Locations</a> <a href=\"#internships\">Internships</a> <a href=\"#apply\">How to apply</a> <a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"trust-item\"><b>93+</b><span>countries served</span></span><span class=\"trust-item\"><b>5</b><span>offices \u00b7 4 continents</span></span><span class=\"trust-item\"><b>Since 1998</b><span>27+ years of memory firsts</span></span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#openings\">View open roles</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#apply\">Submit an application</a></div></div></div><section id=\"why\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(22px,3vw,36px)\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Why <img class=\"ilog\" src=\"assets/img/logo.webp?v=219974299b\" alt=\"TwinMOS\" style=\"height:14px;width:auto\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><h2 class=\"h2\">Six reasons to build here</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g3\"><div class=\"card card-pad\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15.5px\">Global impact</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Your work reaches customers in 93+ countries across five continents.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15.5px\">Heritage of innovation</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">27+ years of expertise \u2014 from DDR1 pioneers to DDR5 and PCIe Gen 5 leaders.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15.5px\">Cutting-edge technology</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Work on industry-first products like the CoreX Pro Gen 5 NVMe SSD and VOLTX RGB DDR5.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15.5px\">Diverse global team</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Collaborate with colleagues across Taipei, Dubai, Cologne, San Jose and Dongguan.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15.5px\">Growth opportunities</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Professional development in a rapidly scaling technology business.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15.5px\">Competitive value</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Market-competitive compensation with performance-based incentives.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"values\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:1080px\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">What we value</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Four values, one motto \u2014 &ldquo;Innovation, Perfection, and Quality&rdquo;</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g2\"><div class=\"card card-pad val-card\"><b class=\"val-name\">Integrity</b><p>We do business honestly and transparently with partners, customers and each other \u2014 the foundation of trust that has sustained TwinMOS for over 27 years.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad val-card\"><b class=\"val-name\">Quality</b><p>Rigorous pre-delivery testing is not just for products; it reflects our standards in everything we do, from burn-in validation to campaign reviews.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad val-card\"><b class=\"val-name\">Innovation</b><p>From DDR1 to DDR5 and PCIe Gen 5, we continuously push technological boundaries \u2014 in the lab and in every department.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad val-card\"><b class=\"val-name\">Collaboration</b><p>Cross-functional teamwork across regions, disciplines and time zones drives our success \u2014 the best ideas emerge when different minds connect.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"openings\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Openings</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Representative openings</h2></div><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"#apply\">Submit a general application</a></div><p class=\"form-note\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">We hire across engineering (hardware, firmware, thermal, PCB, compatibility), sales and key accounts, marketing, supply-chain operations, quality assurance and customer service \u2014 at every experience level.</p><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Focus</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Firmware Engineer \u2014 SSD</b><br><span class=\"form-note\">Taipei, TW</span></td><td>Embedded firmware for NVMe controllers; C, low-level storage stacks, Gen 5 platforms.</td><td><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com?subject=Firmware Engineer \u2014 SSD\">Apply / ask</a></td></tr><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Validation Engineer \u2014 DRAM</b><br><span class=\"form-note\">Taipei, TW</span></td><td>Signal integrity, compatibility and burn-in validation across DDR4/DDR5 lines.</td><td><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com?subject=Validation Engineer \u2014 DRAM\">Apply / ask</a></td></tr><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Regional Sales Manager \u2014 MEA</b><br><span class=\"form-note\">Dubai, UAE (DAFZA)</span></td><td>Channel development across Middle East &amp; Africa with our DAFZA office team.</td><td><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com?subject=Regional Sales Manager \u2014 MEA\">Apply / ask</a></td></tr><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Digital Marketing Specialist</b><br><span class=\"form-note\">Taipei, TW</span></td><td>SEO, performance campaigns and product launches across 9 locale markets.</td><td><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com?subject=Digital Marketing Specialist\">Apply / ask</a></td></tr><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Quality Engineer</b><br><span class=\"form-note\">Dongguan, CN</span></td><td>On-line quality systems, SPC and supplier quality for the manufacturing base.</td><td><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com?subject=Quality Engineer\">Apply / ask</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"note-box\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">\ud83d\udccb Representative openings for the prototype \u2014 live vacancies and internship tracks are published via our HR mailbox, <a href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com\">hr@twinmos.com</a>. Unsolicited applications are welcome: select \"General Application\" on the <a href=\"#apply\">form below</a>.</div></div></section><section id=\"departments\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Departments</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Find your place in the technology</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g3\"><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Engineering</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Building the technology of tomorrow</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Design next-generation DDR5 DRAM modules and PCIe Gen 5 NVMe SSDs</li><li>Develop firmware for SSD controllers and memory management</li><li>Engineer thermal solutions \u2014 graphene heatsinks and aluminium heatspreaders</li><li>Validate hardware compatibility across desktop, laptop, server and gaming platforms</li></ul><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Roles:</b> Hardware Design Engineer (DRAM/SSD), Firmware Engineer, PCB Layout Engineer, Thermal Design Engineer, Validation &amp; Compatibility Engineer, R&amp;D Scientist<br><b>You bring:</b> EE / computer-engineering degree, CAD &amp; simulation tools, DDR / NAND / PCIe knowledge, detail-driven problem solving</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Sales</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Connecting technology with the world</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Manage distributor relationships and channel partnerships across 93+ countries</li><li>Develop and execute regional sales strategies to meet revenue targets</li><li>Cultivate new business opportunities in emerging markets</li><li>Represent TwinMOS at COMPUTEX, GITEX and regional exhibitions</li></ul><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Roles:</b> Regional Sales Manager, Key Account Manager, Business Development Representative, Channel Sales Specialist, Enterprise Sales Executive, Sales Operations Analyst<br><b>You bring:</b> Business / marketing / engineering background, communication and negotiation, relationship building, willingness to travel internationally</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Marketing</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Telling the TwinMOS story</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Plan and execute product launches for new DRAM and SSD lines</li><li>Run digital campaigns across social, search and display in nine locale markets</li><li>Create datasheets, videos, blog content and technical documentation</li><li>Organize event presence at COMPUTEX, gaming conventions and industry expos</li></ul><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Roles:</b> Product Marketing Manager, Digital Marketing Specialist, Content Creator / Copywriter, Social Media Manager, Graphic Designer, Event Marketing Coordinator, Brand Manager<br><b>You bring:</b> Marketing / communications / design background, creativity and storytelling, marketing tools and analytics, multilingual valued</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Operations</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Keeping the world supplied</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Oversee end-to-end supply chain and logistics operations</li><li>Manage inventory planning and demand forecasting</li><li>Coordinate with manufacturing partners in Taiwan and China</li><li>Handle procurement of NAND flash, controllers and components; ensure import/export compliance</li></ul><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Roles:</b> Supply Chain Manager, Procurement Specialist, Logistics Coordinator, Inventory Planner, Import/Export Compliance Officer, Warehouse Operations Manager<br><b>You bring:</b> Supply-chain / business / engineering background, analytical mindset, ERP and inventory tools, international-trade regulations</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Quality Assurance</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Excellence in every product</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Incoming quality control on raw materials and components</li><li>Burn-in validation and stress testing on finished products \u2014 a standard maintained since 1998</li><li>Investigate and analyze product failures to drive continuous improvement</li><li>Maintain compliance with ISO, CE, FCC, RoHS and REACH standards</li></ul><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Roles:</b> Quality Assurance Engineer, Lab Test Technician, Failure Analysis Engineer, Compliance Specialist, Quality Control Inspector, Reliability Engineer<br><b>You bring:</b> Engineering or technical degree, testing equipment and methodologies, ISO 9001 quality systems, methodical and precise</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Customer Service</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Supporting our global community</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Provide technical support for memory and SSD products</li><li>Administer warranty policies and process RMA requests</li><li>Maintain knowledge bases and support documentation</li><li>Gather customer feedback to inform product improvements</li></ul><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Roles:</b> Technical Support Specialist, Warranty Administrator, Customer Success Manager, Support Team Lead, Knowledge Base Manager, Partner Support Coordinator<br><b>You bring:</b> Technical aptitude and troubleshooting, excellent written and verbal communication, patience and empathy, PC hardware and OS knowledge</p></div></div><div class=\"note-box\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Career growth often spans departments \u2014 many of our leaders have experience across multiple functions. We encourage internal mobility. Not sure where you fit? <a href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com\">Ask HR for a career consultation</a>.</div></div></section><section id=\"life\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Life at <img class=\"ilog\" src=\"assets/img/logo.webp?v=219974299b\" alt=\"TwinMOS\" style=\"height:15px;width:auto\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><h2 class=\"h2\">More than a job \u2014 a career with purpose</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g2\"><div class=\"card card-pad\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"font-size:17px\">Our culture</h3><p class=\"form-note\" style=\"margin:6px 0 10px\">Great products come from great people. Whether you are designing the next VOLTX DDR5 module, optimizing CoreX Pro Gen 5 firmware or supporting a distributor in an emerging market, your contribution has tangible global impact.</p><ul class=\"dep-do val-list\"><li><b>Respect</b><span> \u2014 Every voice matters, regardless of role, region or tenure.</span></li><li><b>Transparency</b><span> \u2014 Open communication between leadership and teams.</span></li><li><b>Accountability</b><span> \u2014 We take ownership of our work and learn from every outcome.</span></li><li><b>Celebration</b><span> \u2014 We recognize milestones, product launches and personal achievements.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"font-size:17px\">Growth &amp; development</h3><p class=\"form-note\" style=\"margin:6px 0 10px\">We invest in our people through structured learning, mentorship and hands-on exposure to new technologies and markets.</p><ul class=\"dep-do val-list\"><li><b>On-the-job learning</b><span> \u2014 Work alongside industry veterans on real projects \u2014 from next-gen product development to global distribution strategy.</span></li><li><b>Mentorship programs</b><span> \u2014 New hires are paired with experienced mentors who share institutional knowledge and help navigate career paths.</span></li><li><b>Technical training</b><span> \u2014 DDR5 architecture, PCIe Gen 5 controller integration, NAND flash management, thermal design and AI-driven storage optimization.</span></li><li><b>Leadership development</b><span> \u2014 High-potential employees join leadership workshops, cross-functional project leadership and executive exposure programs.</span></li><li><b>Industry exposure</b><span> \u2014 Represent TwinMOS at COMPUTEX Taipei, GITEX Dubai and regional trade shows \u2014 network with industry leaders and stay ahead of trends.</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Emerging markets</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Work on expansion into high-growth regions like Africa, South Asia and Southeast Asia.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Cross-cultural collaboration</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Learn from colleagues with diverse backgrounds and professional experiences.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Travel opportunities</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Select roles include travel to COMPUTEX Taipei, GITEX Dubai, partner meetings and regional offices.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Global career mobility</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Potential for international assignments and cross-office transfers as you grow.</p></div></div><div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-top:clamp(28px,4vw,44px)\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Voices from the team</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"font-size:clamp(21px,3vw,28px)\">What colleagues say</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g2\"><div class=\"card card-pad testi-card\"><span class=\"testi-quote\">\"</span><p>Working at TwinMOS has allowed me to grow professionally and personally. The collaborative culture and challenging projects keep me motivated every day.</p><div class=\"testi-who\"><b>Senior Software Developer</b><span>Engineering \u00b7 attribution pending written release</span></div></div><div class=\"card card-pad testi-card\"><span class=\"testi-quote\">\"</span><p>TwinMOS\u2019s focus on innovation and customer satisfaction aligns perfectly with my professional goals. The support and resources provided here are exceptional.</p><div class=\"testi-who\"><b>Sales Executive</b><span>Sales \u00b7 attribution pending written release</span></div></div></div><p class=\"form-note\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\ud83d\udd12 Testimonials publish only with signed releases \u2014 role attributions shown per the verified-claims policy.</p><div class=\"note-box\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><b>Diversity &amp; inclusion:</b> equal opportunity hiring across all roles and levels, inclusive team practices that respect cultural and religious observances, employee resource groups and cultural celebrations, and zero tolerance for discrimination or harassment. <img class=\"ilog\" src=\"assets/img/logo.webp?v=219974299b\" alt=\"TwinMOS\" style=\"height:13px;width:auto\" loading=\"lazy\"> is an equal opportunity employer \u2014 we celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.</div></div></section><section id=\"benefits\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Benefits</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Rewarding excellence, supporting wellbeing</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g2\"><div class=\"card card-pad\"><span class=\"chip\">Compensation</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Rewarding excellence</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Market-competitive base salaries aligned with role, experience and regional benchmarks</li><li>Performance-based incentives tied to individual, team and company success</li><li>Spot awards, structured annual reviews and long-service awards</li></ul></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><span class=\"chip\">Development</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Growing our people</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Technical training and certifications \u2014 DDR5, NAND management, PCIe Gen 5, thermal design</li><li>Mentorship from senior leaders and cross-functional project exposure</li><li>Conference and trade-show attendance: COMPUTEX, GITEX, CES and regional events</li><li>Online learning platforms and tuition reimbursement (subject to approval)</li></ul></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><span class=\"chip\">Health &amp; wellness</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Supporting wellbeing</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Medical insurance for employees and eligible dependents (by location and local law)</li><li>Dental and vision coverage where available; annual health check-ups</li><li>Mental health support, wellness initiatives and fitness support (location-dependent)</li></ul></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><span class=\"chip\">Work-life balance</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Time to recharge</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\"><li>Annual, sick, parental and bereavement leave per regional standards</li><li>Flexible, remote or hybrid arrangements for select roles</li><li>Team-building events, annual celebrations and cultural events</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-top:clamp(26px,3.5vw,40px)\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Also included</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2.6vw,25px)\">Extras on top of the core package</h2></div></div><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>Benefit</th><th>What it includes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Employee product purchase program</b></td><td>Exclusive discounts on TwinMOS memory modules, SSDs and accessories</td></tr><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Relocation assistance</b></td><td>Visa sponsorship, housing allowance and moving expenses for select roles</td></tr><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Travel opportunities</b></td><td>Business travel to trade shows, partner meetings and regional offices</td></tr><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Meal &amp; transportation allowances</b></td><td>Subsidies available at select locations</td></tr><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Retirement &amp; savings plans</b></td><td>Employer-matched contributions where applicable by region</td></tr><tr><td><b style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Employee referral bonuses</b></td><td>Rewards for referring successful candidates</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Dubai, UAE</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Comprehensive health insurance, annual air-ticket allowance, end-of-service benefits</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Taipei, Taiwan</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">National health insurance, labor insurance, pension contributions</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Cologne, Germany</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Statutory health insurance, pension scheme, strong worker protections</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">San Jose, USA</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Competitive health, dental and vision packages, 401(k) matching</p></div></div><div class=\"note-box\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Benefit availability and specifics vary by country, role and employment type to comply with local regulations \u2014 details are provided during the offer process. Questions about benefits in your region: <a href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com\">hr@twinmos.com</a>.</div></div></section><section id=\"locations\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Locations</span><h2 class=\"h2\">A global network, a local presence</h2></div><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Office addresses &amp; contacts</a></div><div class=\"grid g3\"><div class=\"card card-pad loc-card\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><span class=\"of-flag\" style=\"font-size:24px\">\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\uddfc</span><div><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:16px\">Taipei, Taiwan</b><div class=\"form-note\">Global HQ &amp; R&amp;D Center</div></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:13.5px\">Research &amp; development, product design, manufacturing coordination, quality engineering.</p><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Teams you could join:</b> Hardware engineering, firmware development, PCB design, thermal engineering, product management, QA, R&amp;D leadership.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad loc-card\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><span class=\"of-flag\" style=\"font-size:24px\">\ud83c\udde6\ud83c\uddea</span><div><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:16px\">Dubai, UAE (DAFZA)</b><div class=\"form-note\">International operations hub</div></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:13.5px\">Sales, marketing, partner management, finance and HR for the Middle East, Africa, CIS and South Asia.</p><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Teams you could join:</b> Senior management, sales leadership, marketing, finance, HR, international business development, operations.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad loc-card\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><span class=\"of-flag\" style=\"font-size:24px\">\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddf3</span><div><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:16px\">Dongguan, China</b><div class=\"form-note\">Manufacturing facility</div></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:13.5px\">Manufacturing base serving the global catalog \u2014 production and on-line quality systems.</p><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Teams you could join:</b> Quality engineering, SPC and supplier quality, production and warehouse operations.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad loc-card\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><span class=\"of-flag\" style=\"font-size:24px\">\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea</span><div><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:16px\">Cologne, Germany</b><div class=\"form-note\">European office</div></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:13.5px\">European market expansion, partner relations, distribution management, regulatory compliance (CE, UKCA, REACH, RoHS).</p><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Teams you could join:</b> European sales, partner management, regulatory affairs, logistics, technical support.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad loc-card\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\"><span class=\"of-flag\" style=\"font-size:24px\">\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8</span><div><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:16px\">San Jose, USA</b><div class=\"form-note\">American office</div></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:13.5px\">North American market development, enterprise sales, technical support and brand building.</p><p class=\"dep-roles\"><b>Teams you could join:</b> North American sales, enterprise business development, technical marketing, customer success, product management.</p></div></div><div class=\"note-box\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><b>Remote &amp; hybrid:</b> select roles offer flexible, remote or hybrid arrangements depending on function, seniority and location \u2014 discussed during recruitment. Functions that most often support remote work: Software and firmware development \u00b7 Digital marketing and content creation \u00b7 Technical writing and documentation \u00b7 Certain sales and customer support roles \u00b7 Data analysis and business intelligence.</div></div></section><section id=\"internships\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Early careers</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Internships &amp; graduate programs</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g2\"><div class=\"card card-pad\"><span class=\"chip\">Internship \u00b7 8\u201316 weeks</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Project-based, mentor-guided</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><li><b>Duration</b> \u2014 8\u201316 weeks, flexible around the academic calendar</li><li><b>Locations</b> \u2014 Taipei HQ &amp; R&amp;D, Dubai, Cologne and San Jose offices</li><li><b>Schedule</b> \u2014 full-time preferred; part-time possible for local students</li><li><b>Intakes</b> \u2014 rolling admissions, primary intakes in January, May and September</li><li><b>Stipends</b> \u2014 all internships are paid, aligned with local market standards</li></ul></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><span class=\"chip\">Graduate \u00b7 12\u201324 months</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Rotation or deep specialization</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><li><b>Duration</b> \u2014 12\u201324 months, varying by function and location</li><li><b>Structure</b> \u2014 rotational assignments across departments, or deep specialization in one area</li><li><b>Mentorship</b> \u2014 dedicated mentor plus access to senior leadership</li><li><b>Outcome</b> \u2014 a pathway to full-time employment on successful completion</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-top:clamp(26px,3.5vw,40px)\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Who we look for</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2.6vw,25px)\">Ambitious, curious, hands-on</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g2\"><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Technical fields</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Electrical / computer engineering and related degrees \u2014 hardware design, firmware, testing and R&amp;D roles.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Business fields</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Business administration, marketing or supply-chain management \u2014 sales, marketing, operations and BD roles.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">IT &amp; computer science</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Software, firmware, technical support and systems roles.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Any discipline</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">With demonstrated interest in hardware technology \u2014 curiosity and passion count as much as formal qualifications.</p></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;align-items:center\"><span class=\"form-note\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Strong candidates:</span><span class=\"chip\">Strong academic performance (GPA requirements vary by program)</span><span class=\"chip\">Demonstrated interest in technology, hardware or semiconductors</span><span class=\"chip\">Excellent communication and teamwork skills</span><span class=\"chip\">Proactive attitude and willingness to take initiative</span><span class=\"chip\">Fluency in English \u2014 additional languages are a plus for regional roles</span></div><div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-top:clamp(26px,3.5vw,40px)\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Tracks</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2.6vw,25px)\">Five internship tracks</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g3\"><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Engineering</span><ul class=\"dep-do\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><li>Hardware design and validation testing</li><li>Firmware development and debugging</li><li>Thermal and power-management analysis</li><li>PCB layout and signal-integrity fundamentals</li></ul></div><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Marketing</span><ul class=\"dep-do\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><li>Marketing strategies and campaigns</li><li>Market research and competitive analysis</li><li>Social, blog and product-page content</li><li>Event planning and trade-show coordination</li></ul></div><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Sales &amp; BD</span><ul class=\"dep-do\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><li>Lead generation and market research</li><li>Sales presentations and proposals</li><li>Distributor management and channel partnerships</li><li>Market-expansion planning</li></ul></div><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Operations &amp; supply chain</span><ul class=\"dep-do\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><li>Inventory planning and demand forecasting</li><li>Procurement and vendor management</li><li>Logistics and import/export compliance</li><li>Process-improvement initiatives</li></ul></div><div class=\"card card-pad dep-card\"><span class=\"chip\">Customer support</span><ul class=\"dep-do\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><li>Customer inquiries and technical issues</li><li>Knowledge bases and support docs</li><li>Warranty administration and RMA processes</li><li>Product training sessions</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Hands-on technical experience</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Work with real DRAM, SSD and storage products; join testing, validation and QA processes; use industry-standard tools.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Business &amp; operational exposure</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">See how global semiconductor supply chains run; learn distributor management and channel sales; contribute to launches.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Professional development</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">One-on-one mentorship, regular feedback sessions and networking with leaders across the organization.</p></div><div class=\"card card-pad perk-card\"><b style=\"color:var(--ink);font-size:15px\">Career advancement</b><p style=\"margin-top:6px\">Potential conversion to full-time roles \u2014 many of our current full-time employees started as interns; priority for the graduate program.</p></div></div><div class=\"note-box\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Internships are real assignments with real business outcomes \u2014 you get a mentor, join team meetings and present to department leadership at the end of the program. Recent graduates (within 12 months) are eligible for both programs, and many of our full-time team members started as interns. <a href=\"#apply\">Apply</a> selecting \"Internship\" or \"Graduate Program\" as the position type.</div></div></section><section id=\"apply\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Apply</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Take the first step</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g2 apply-grid\"><div class=\"card card-pad\" data-form-box><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"font-size:17px\">General application</h3><p class=\"form-note\" style=\"margin:6px 0 14px\">Fields marked <span class=\"req\">*</span> are required. Tailor your cover letter to the role \u2014 for technical and creative roles, include portfolio, GitHub or work-sample links.</p><form data-tm-form novalidate data-success=\"Application received \u2014 HR will review it and respond within 2\u20133 weeks.\"><div class=\"form-grid\"><div class=\"fg\" data-req><label>Full name <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"input\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\"><span class=\"err\">Enter your name</span></div><div class=\"fg\" data-req><label>Email address <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"input\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"><span class=\"err\">Enter a valid email</span></div><div class=\"fg\"><label>Phone (with country code)</label><input class=\"input\" type=\"tel\" autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+971\u2026, +886\u2026, +91\u2026\"></div><div class=\"fg\"><label>Country / region</label><input class=\"input\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"country-name\"></div><div class=\"fg\" data-req><label>Position applied for <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\">Select\u2026</option><option>General Application</option><option>Internship</option><option>Graduate Program</option><option>Firmware Engineer \u2014 SSD</option><option>Validation Engineer \u2014 DRAM</option><option>Regional Sales Manager \u2014 MEA</option><option>Digital Marketing Specialist</option><option>Quality Engineer</option></select><span class=\"err\">Pick a position type</span></div><div class=\"fg\"><label>Preferred department</label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\">No preference</option><option>Engineering</option><option>Sales</option><option>Marketing</option><option>Operations</option><option>Quality Assurance</option><option>Customer Service</option></select></div><div class=\"fg\"><label>Preferred location</label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\">No preference</option><option>Taipei, Taiwan</option><option>Dubai, UAE</option><option>Dongguan, China</option><option>Cologne, Germany</option><option>San Jose, USA</option><option>Remote / hybrid</option></select></div><div class=\"fg\"><label>Employment type</label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\">Select\u2026</option><option>Full-time</option><option>Part-time</option><option>Contract</option><option>Internship</option></select></div><div class=\"fg\"><label>Years of experience</label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\">Select\u2026</option><option>0\u20132</option><option>3\u20135</option><option>6\u201310</option><option>10+</option></select></div><div class=\"fg\"><label>Notice period</label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\">Select\u2026</option><option>Immediate</option><option>2 weeks</option><option>1 month</option><option>3 months+</option></select></div><div class=\"fg\" data-req><label>Highest education <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\">Select\u2026</option><option>High school</option><option>Bachelor\u2019s</option><option>Master\u2019s</option><option>PhD</option><option>Other</option></select><span class=\"err\">Pick an education level</span></div><div class=\"fg\"><label>LinkedIn / portfolio URL</label><input class=\"input\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://\u2026\"></div><div class=\"fg\"><label>How did you hear about us?</label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\">Select\u2026</option><option>LinkedIn</option><option>Website</option><option>Referral</option><option>Job board</option><option>Event</option><option>Social media</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div class=\"fg full\" data-req data-min=\"20\"><label>Cover letter \u2014 why <img class=\"ilog\" src=\"assets/img/logo.webp?v=219974299b\" alt=\"TwinMOS\" style=\"height:14px;width:auto\" loading=\"lazy\">, why this role? <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><textarea class=\"input\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Tell us what drives you, and what you would bring to the team\u2026\"></textarea><span class=\"err\">A few sentences (20+ characters) help us route your application</span></div><div class=\"fg full\" data-req><label>Privacy consent <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\">Select\u2026</option><option>Yes \u2014 I have read the Job Applicant Privacy Notice</option><option>I have questions first \u2014 contact me</option></select><span class=\"err\">Please choose an option</span></div></div><button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" type=\"submit\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Submit application</button><p class=\"form-note\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Prototype: nothing is sent from your browser. The production form accepts attachments \u2014 CV (PDF/Word, 5 MB), cover letter, transcripts, certificates and portfolios up to 10 MB.</p></form></div><div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"font-size:17px\">What happens next</h3><ol class=\"proc-list\"><li><span class=\"pnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><div><b>Application review</b><span>HR reviews your application within 2\u20133 weeks of submission.</span></div></li><li><span class=\"pnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><div><b>Screening</b><span>Shortlisted candidates are contacted to schedule an initial phone or video screening.</span></div></li><li><span class=\"pnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><div><b>Interviews</b><span>Technical / functional interviews, then a final conversation with department leadership.</span></div></li><li><span class=\"pnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><div><b>Offer</b><span>A formal offer with detailed compensation and benefits information.</span></div></li><li><span class=\"pnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><div><b>Onboarding</b><span>Welcome to the TwinMOS team!</span></div></li></ol><p class=\"form-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Typical total timeline: <b>2\u20134 weeks</b> from application to offer, varying by role and location. Shortlisted candidates hear from us within 2\u20133 weeks.</p></div><div class=\"note-box\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\ud83d\udcc4 <b>Attach in the production build:</b> CV (required, PDF/Word \u2264 5 MB) \u00b7 cover letter \u00b7 academic transcripts (internships &amp; graduate program) \u00b7 certificates \u00b7 portfolio or work samples (technical/creative roles) \u2014 links to GitHub or published work are welcome.</div><div class=\"note-box\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Prefer email? Send your CV to <a href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com\">hr@twinmos.com</a> with the job title in the subject line.</div></div></div></div></section><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I apply for a job at TwinMOS?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"You can apply through our online Job Application Form. Submit your resume, cover letter, and any supporting documents. Please include the job title you are applying for in your cover letter or application subject line. For technical and creative roles, we strongly encourage you to include links to your portfolio, GitHub profile, or relevant work samples.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What should I include in my application?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A complete application typically includes: \u2014 Resume / CV \u2014 Current, well-formatted, and tailored to the role \u2014 Cover Letter \u2014 Explaining your interest in TwinMOS and why you are a great fit for the specific role \u2014 Portfolio / Work Samples \u2014 Links to GitHub, Behance, personal websites, or published work (for technical and creative roles) \u2014 Certifications \u2014 Relevant professional or technical certifications \u2014 Academic Transcripts \u2014 For internship and graduate program applicants\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I apply for multiple positions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. You may apply for multiple roles that match your skills and interests. We recommend tailoring your cover letter for each position to highlight the most relevant experience. Please submit a separate application for each role.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Do you accept unsolicited applications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. You may submit a general application through our Job Application Form even if no specific role is currently open. Select \\\"General Application\\\" as the position type and specify your preferred department and location. We review general applications when relevant positions become available.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"I submitted my application. What happens next?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"1) Application Review (1\u20132 weeks) \u2014 Our HR team reviews your application 2) Screening (1 week) \u2014 Shortlisted candidates are contacted for an initial phone or video screening 3) Interviews (1\u20132 weeks) \u2014 Successful candidates proceed to technical/functional and final interviews 4) Offer (1 week) \u2014 Selected candidates receive a formal offer 5) Onboarding \u2014 Welcome to TwinMOS! Total timeline: typically 2\u20134 weeks, though this may vary by role and location. ---\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the recruitment process?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Our typical process includes: 1) Application Review \u2014 HR and the hiring manager review your resume and cover letter 2) Phone or Video Screening \u2014 A 20\u201330 minute conversation with HR to discuss your background, motivations, and fit 3) Technical or Skills Assessment \u2014 For engineering and technical roles, this may include a coding test, design exercise, or case study. For marketing and creative roles, a portfolio review may be requested 4) Final Interview \u2014 A conversation with department leadership to assess cultural fit, strategic thinking, and long-term potential 5) Offer and Background Verification \u2014 Reference checks and employment verification before the final offer\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How should I prepare for a TwinMOS interview?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\u2014 Research TwinMOS \u2014 Familiarize yourself with our products (DDR5, PCIe Gen 5 SSDs), markets, and recent news (e.g., COMPUTEX 2025) \u2014 Know the Role \u2014 Review the job description thoroughly and prepare examples of how your experience aligns \u2014 Prepare Questions \u2014 Come with thoughtful questions about the team, projects, and growth opportunities \u2014 Technical Roles \u2014 Be ready to discuss your technical projects, problem-solving approach, and familiarity with relevant tools \u2014 Be Yourself \u2014 We value authenticity and want to understand what drives you\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Will I receive feedback if I am not selected?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Due to the volume of applications we receive, we are unable to provide personalized feedback to every applicant. However, shortlisted candidates who complete interviews will receive feedback upon request.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I reapply if I was not selected previously?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. We encourage candidates to reapply for future openings, especially if they have gained additional experience or skills since their last application. There is no waiting period for reapplication. ---\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Do you offer remote or hybrid work?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Some roles offer flexible, remote, or hybrid arrangements depending on the function, seniority, and location. Roles in engineering (software/firmware), digital marketing, content creation, and technical writing are more likely to offer remote options. Hardware engineering, lab-based quality assurance, and certain operations roles typically require on-site presence. Specific work arrangements are discussed during the recruitment process.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which locations are currently hiring?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"We have active recruitment across our global offices: \u2014 Dubai, UAE \u2014 Headquarters roles in sales, marketing, operations, finance, and HR \u2014 Taipei, Taiwan \u2014 R&D, hardware engineering, firmware, and quality assurance \u2014 Cologne, Germany \u2014 European sales, partner management, and regulatory affairs \u2014 San Jose, USA \u2014 North American sales, enterprise business development, and technical marketing\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Do you sponsor work visas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Visa sponsorship is evaluated on a case-by-case basis depending on the role, location, and candidate qualifications. This is discussed during the offer stage. We are more likely to sponsor visas for senior technical roles and positions where local talent is scarce.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Do you offer relocation assistance?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Relocation assistance is available for select roles, particularly senior positions and specialized technical roles. Assistance may include visa sponsorship, moving expenses, temporary housing, and settling-in support. Details are provided during the offer process. ---\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the salary range for [specific role]?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Salaries at TwinMOS are competitive and aligned with regional market benchmarks, role responsibilities, and your experience level. Specific salary ranges are shared during the offer stage. We encourage you to include your salary expectations in your application.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What benefits does TwinMOS offer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"TwinMOS offers a comprehensive benefits package that varies by location. Common benefits include: \u2014 Competitive base salary and performance bonuses \u2014 Health insurance and wellness programs \u2014 Professional development and training \u2014 Flexible work arrangements (where applicable) \u2014 Employee product purchase discounts \u2014 Conference and trade show attendance \u2014 Retirement and savings plans (where applicable) For detailed information, visit our Benefits & Compensation page.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Are internships paid?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, all TwinMOS internships offer competitive stipends aligned with local market standards. Specific compensation details are shared during the offer process. ---\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Who is eligible for the internship program?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Our internship program is open to: \u2014 Current university students (undergraduate and graduate) \u2014 Recent graduates (within 12 months of graduation) \u2014 Candidates with demonstrated interest in technology, hardware, or semiconductors\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How long are internships?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Internships typically span 8\u201316 weeks, with flexible start dates to accommodate academic calendars. Primary intakes are in January, May, and September.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a possibility of full-time employment after the internship?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. Many of our full-time team members began their TwinMOS journey as interns. Conversion to full-time roles is based on performance, business needs, and mutual interest. We view our internship program as a primary pipeline for future talent.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the graduate program?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Our graduate program is a structured 12\u201324 month program designed for recent graduates. Participants gain broad exposure to the business through rotational assignments or deep specialization, with dedicated mentorship and a pathway to full-time employment. ---\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is my personal data protected?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"TwinMOS handles applicant data in accordance with our Job Applicant Privacy Notice. We collect and use your data solely for recruitment purposes. Key protections include: \u2014 Data retained for up to 24 months after the recruitment process concludes \u2014 No sale of applicant data to third parties \u2014 Secure storage with encryption and access controls \u2014 Your right to access, correct, or delete your data\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Who has access to my application?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Your application is accessible to HR personnel, hiring managers, and relevant department leaders involved in the recruitment process. We do not share your data with third parties for marketing purposes. ---\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is TwinMOS an equal opportunity employer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. TwinMOS is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability, or any other protected characteristic.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does TwinMOS have diversity initiatives?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. We are committed to building a workforce that reflects the global markets we serve. Our initiatives include equal opportunity hiring, inclusive team practices, cultural celebration events, and zero-tolerance policies for discrimination or harassment. ---\"}}]}</script><section id=\"faq\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:980px\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAQ</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Everything about joining <img class=\"ilog\" src=\"assets/img/logo.webp?v=219974299b\" alt=\"TwinMOS\" style=\"height:14px;width:auto\" loading=\"lazy\"></h2></div></div><div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\"><button class=\"tab on\" data-tab=\"cfaq0\" role=\"tab\">Applying</button><button class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"cfaq1\" role=\"tab\">Process</button><button class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"cfaq2\" role=\"tab\">Remote &amp; locations</button><button class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"cfaq3\" role=\"tab\">Pay &amp; benefits</button><button class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"cfaq4\" role=\"tab\">Internships</button><button class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"cfaq5\" role=\"tab\">Data &amp; privacy</button><button class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"cfaq6\" role=\"tab\">Diversity</button></div><div class=\"tabpane on\" id=\"cfaq0\"><div class=\"acc\"><details open><summary>How do I apply for a job at TwinMOS?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">You can apply through our online Job Application Form. Submit your resume, cover letter, and any supporting documents. Please include the job title you are applying for in your cover letter or application subject line. For technical and creative roles, we strongly encourage you to include links to your portfolio, GitHub profile, or relevant work samples.</div></details><details><summary>What should I include in my application?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">A complete application typically includes: \u2014 Resume / CV \u2014 Current, well-formatted, and tailored to the role \u2014 Cover Letter \u2014 Explaining your interest in TwinMOS and why you are a great fit for the specific role \u2014 Portfolio / Work Samples \u2014 Links to GitHub, Behance, personal websites, or published work (for technical and creative roles) \u2014 Certifications \u2014 Relevant professional or technical certifications \u2014 Academic Transcripts \u2014 For internship and graduate program applicants</div></details><details><summary>Can I apply for multiple positions?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Yes. You may apply for multiple roles that match your skills and interests. We recommend tailoring your cover letter for each position to highlight the most relevant experience. Please submit a separate application for each role.</div></details><details><summary>Do you accept unsolicited applications?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Yes. You may submit a general application through our Job Application Form even if no specific role is currently open. Select &quot;General Application&quot; as the position type and specify your preferred department and location. We review general applications when relevant positions become available.</div></details><details><summary>I submitted my application. What happens next?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">1) Application Review (1\u20132 weeks) \u2014 Our HR team reviews your application 2) Screening (1 week) \u2014 Shortlisted candidates are contacted for an initial phone or video screening 3) Interviews (1\u20132 weeks) \u2014 Successful candidates proceed to technical/functional and final interviews 4) Offer (1 week) \u2014 Selected candidates receive a formal offer 5) Onboarding \u2014 Welcome to TwinMOS! Total timeline: typically 2\u20134 weeks, though this may vary by role and location. ---</div></details></div></div><div class=\"tabpane\" id=\"cfaq1\"><div class=\"acc\"><details><summary>What is the recruitment process?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Our typical process includes: 1) Application Review \u2014 HR and the hiring manager review your resume and cover letter 2) Phone or Video Screening \u2014 A 20\u201330 minute conversation with HR to discuss your background, motivations, and fit 3) Technical or Skills Assessment \u2014 For engineering and technical roles, this may include a coding test, design exercise, or case study. For marketing and creative roles, a portfolio review may be requested 4) Final Interview \u2014 A conversation with department leadership to assess cultural fit, strategic thinking, and long-term potential 5) Offer and Background Verification \u2014 Reference checks and employment verification before the final offer</div></details><details><summary>How should I prepare for a TwinMOS interview?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">\u2014 Research TwinMOS \u2014 Familiarize yourself with our products (DDR5, PCIe Gen 5 SSDs), markets, and recent news (e.g., COMPUTEX 2025) \u2014 Know the Role \u2014 Review the job description thoroughly and prepare examples of how your experience aligns \u2014 Prepare Questions \u2014 Come with thoughtful questions about the team, projects, and growth opportunities \u2014 Technical Roles \u2014 Be ready to discuss your technical projects, problem-solving approach, and familiarity with relevant tools \u2014 Be Yourself \u2014 We value authenticity and want to understand what drives you</div></details><details><summary>Will I receive feedback if I am not selected?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Due to the volume of applications we receive, we are unable to provide personalized feedback to every applicant. However, shortlisted candidates who complete interviews will receive feedback upon request.</div></details><details><summary>Can I reapply if I was not selected previously?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Yes. We encourage candidates to reapply for future openings, especially if they have gained additional experience or skills since their last application. There is no waiting period for reapplication. ---</div></details></div></div><div class=\"tabpane\" id=\"cfaq2\"><div class=\"acc\"><details><summary>Do you offer remote or hybrid work?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Some roles offer flexible, remote, or hybrid arrangements depending on the function, seniority, and location. Roles in engineering (software/firmware), digital marketing, content creation, and technical writing are more likely to offer remote options. Hardware engineering, lab-based quality assurance, and certain operations roles typically require on-site presence. Specific work arrangements are discussed during the recruitment process.</div></details><details><summary>Which locations are currently hiring?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">We have active recruitment across our global offices: \u2014 Dubai, UAE \u2014 Headquarters roles in sales, marketing, operations, finance, and HR \u2014 Taipei, Taiwan \u2014 R&amp;D, hardware engineering, firmware, and quality assurance \u2014 Cologne, Germany \u2014 European sales, partner management, and regulatory affairs \u2014 San Jose, USA \u2014 North American sales, enterprise business development, and technical marketing</div></details><details><summary>Do you sponsor work visas?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Visa sponsorship is evaluated on a case-by-case basis depending on the role, location, and candidate qualifications. This is discussed during the offer stage. We are more likely to sponsor visas for senior technical roles and positions where local talent is scarce.</div></details><details><summary>Do you offer relocation assistance?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Relocation assistance is available for select roles, particularly senior positions and specialized technical roles. Assistance may include visa sponsorship, moving expenses, temporary housing, and settling-in support. Details are provided during the offer process. ---</div></details></div></div><div class=\"tabpane\" id=\"cfaq3\"><div class=\"acc\"><details><summary>What is the salary range for [specific role]?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Salaries at TwinMOS are competitive and aligned with regional market benchmarks, role responsibilities, and your experience level. Specific salary ranges are shared during the offer stage. We encourage you to include your salary expectations in your application.</div></details><details><summary>What benefits does TwinMOS offer?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">TwinMOS offers a comprehensive benefits package that varies by location. Common benefits include: \u2014 Competitive base salary and performance bonuses \u2014 Health insurance and wellness programs \u2014 Professional development and training \u2014 Flexible work arrangements (where applicable) \u2014 Employee product purchase discounts \u2014 Conference and trade show attendance \u2014 Retirement and savings plans (where applicable) For detailed information, visit our Benefits &amp; Compensation page.</div></details><details><summary>Are internships paid?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Yes, all TwinMOS internships offer competitive stipends aligned with local market standards. Specific compensation details are shared during the offer process. ---</div></details></div></div><div class=\"tabpane\" id=\"cfaq4\"><div class=\"acc\"><details><summary>Who is eligible for the internship program?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Our internship program is open to: \u2014 Current university students (undergraduate and graduate) \u2014 Recent graduates (within 12 months of graduation) \u2014 Candidates with demonstrated interest in technology, hardware, or semiconductors</div></details><details><summary>How long are internships?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Internships typically span 8\u201316 weeks, with flexible start dates to accommodate academic calendars. Primary intakes are in January, May, and September.</div></details><details><summary>Is there a possibility of full-time employment after the internship?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Absolutely. Many of our full-time team members began their TwinMOS journey as interns. Conversion to full-time roles is based on performance, business needs, and mutual interest. We view our internship program as a primary pipeline for future talent.</div></details><details><summary>What is the graduate program?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Our graduate program is a structured 12\u201324 month program designed for recent graduates. Participants gain broad exposure to the business through rotational assignments or deep specialization, with dedicated mentorship and a pathway to full-time employment. ---</div></details></div></div><div class=\"tabpane\" id=\"cfaq5\"><div class=\"acc\"><details><summary>How is my personal data protected?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">TwinMOS handles applicant data in accordance with our Job Applicant Privacy Notice. We collect and use your data solely for recruitment purposes. Key protections include: \u2014 Data retained for up to 24 months after the recruitment process concludes \u2014 No sale of applicant data to third parties \u2014 Secure storage with encryption and access controls \u2014 Your right to access, correct, or delete your data</div></details><details><summary>Who has access to my application?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Your application is accessible to HR personnel, hiring managers, and relevant department leaders involved in the recruitment process. We do not share your data with third parties for marketing purposes. ---</div></details></div></div><div class=\"tabpane\" id=\"cfaq6\"><div class=\"acc\"><details><summary>Is TwinMOS an equal opportunity employer?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Yes. TwinMOS is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability, or any other protected characteristic.</div></details><details><summary>Does TwinMOS have diversity initiatives?</summary><div class=\"acc-body\">Yes. We are committed to building a workforce that reflects the global markets we serve. Our initiatives include equal opportunity hiring, inclusive team practices, cultural celebration events, and zero-tolerance policies for discrimination or harassment. ---</div></details></div></div><div class=\"note-box\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Still have questions? <a href=\"mailto:hr@twinmos.com\">hr@twinmos.com</a> \u00b7 +971-4-2996421 \u00b7 TwinMOS Technologies Middle East FZE, C-9, DAFZA, P.O. Box 54278, Dubai, UAE.</div></div></section><section id=\"privacy\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:980px\"><div class=\"grid g2\"><div class=\"card card-pad\"><span class=\"chip\">Privacy</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Job Applicant Privacy Notice \u2014 key points</h3><ul class=\"dep-do\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><li>Data is used solely for recruitment and hiring purposes \u2014 never sold or shared for marketing</li><li>Retained for up to 24 months after the recruitment process concludes (or per local law)</li><li>Encryption in transit and at rest, access controls and regular security assessments</li><li>Your rights: access, correction, deletion, restriction and portability \u2014 honored within 30 days</li></ul><p class=\"form-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Controller: TwinMOS Technologies Middle East FZE (DAFZA, Dubai), with affiliated entities in Taiwan, India, Germany and the USA. Data rights requests \u2014 subject line \"Data Rights Request\" \u2014 are answered within 30 days.</p><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"legal.html#privacy\">Read the full privacy policy</a></div><div class=\"card card-pad\"><span class=\"chip\">Stay connected</span><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:16.5px\">Follow <img class=\"ilog\" src=\"assets/img/logo.webp?v=219974299b\" alt=\"TwinMOS\" style=\"height:14px;width:auto\" loading=\"lazy\"> for career updates</h3><p style=